inal temperature of the liquid, we add the variation in temperature to the initial temperature of the liquid. This gives\n\n$$\n-{5.3}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}+{24.7}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}={19.4}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the temperature of the liquid at the end of the experiment was ${19.4}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}.$"}]}
